<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title><%= typeof title !== 'undefined' ? title : 'AI質問' %></title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1f2937;
    }
    .ai-form-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    textarea {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 120px;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .ai-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #4b5563;
    }
    .ai-char-count.is-over {
      color: #b91c1c;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    button {
      padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:disabled {
      opacity: 0.6;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }
    .ai-loading {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      color: #374151;
    }
    .ai-error {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      background: #fef2f2;
      color: #991b1b;
    }
    .ai-answer {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #f9fafb;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>AI質問</h1>
    <p>質問を入力すると、Gemini が回答を生成します（最大 <%= typeof maxLength !== 'undefined' ? maxLength : 1000 %> 文字）。</p>

    <form id="ai-question-form" data-max-length="<%= typeof maxLength !== 'undefined' ? maxLength : 1000 %>" novalidate>
      <div class="ai-form-group">
        <label for="ai-question-input">質問内容</label>
        <textarea
          id="ai-question-input"
          name="question"
          placeholder="例: ExpressとTypeScriptでレイヤー分離するメリットは何ですか？"
        ></textarea>
        <div class="ai-meta">
          <span id="ai-char-count" class="ai-char-count">0 / 1,000文字</span>
          <button id="ai-submit-btn" type="submit">質問する</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>

    <div id="ai-loading" class="ai-loading" hidden aria-live="polite">
      AIが回答を生成しています...
    </div>

    <div id="ai-error" class="ai-error" hidden role="alert" aria-live="assertive"></div>

    <section id="ai-answer-section" class="ai-answer" hidden aria-live="polite">
      <h2>回答</h2>
      <div id="ai-answer-text"></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/ai/ai.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>